<title>SINGAPORE: Seksun to invest US$3.5 mln in China.</title>
<headline>Seksun to invest US$3.5 mln in China.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seksun Precision Engineering Ltd said on Tuesday it will spend US$3.5 million to build a plant in Suzhou, China to design and manufacture precision metal and plastic components.</p>
<p>Seksun said in a statement it would build the factory a new wholly-owned subsidiary, Seksun Precision Engineering (Suzhou) Co Ltd, with a registered capital of US$2.1 million.</p>
<p>Seksun said the investment would be funded from internal resources and bank borrowings and would have no material impact on earnings in the current financial year.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65-870 3093)</p>
</text>
